mlxflow 0.8
1. Read Text         announcement.md
2. <parallel three_locales>   text -> [text, text, text]
     1. Translate   (input:1)   Llama 3.1 8B; to=German

     2. Translate   (input:1)   Llama 3.1 8B; to=Japanese

     3. Translate   (input:1)   Llama 3.1 8B; to=Spanish
3. Template          "{1}"
4. Save Text         announcement-de.md
5. Template    (2)   "{2}"
6. Save Text         announcement-ja.md
7. Template    (2)   "{3}"
8. Save Text         announcement-es.md
